      "id": "V:assert.is_true",
      "kind": "function",
      "name": "is_true",
      "docstring": "Asserts that `condition` is `true`. Panics with a failure message if not.\n\n# Panics\n\n- `baml.panics.AssertionFailed` if `condition` is `false`.\n\n# Examples\n\n```baml\nassert.is_true(true)  // no panic\nassert.is_true(false)  // panic\n```",
